<a class="skip" href="#main">थेट मजकुराकडे जा</a>
<header class="site-header">
<a class="brand" href="/mr/"><span class="logo" aria-hidden="true"></span>ShareBox</a>
<nav class="site-nav">
<ul>
<li><a href="/mr/" aria-current="page">मुख्यपृष्ठ</a></li>
